<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Taybaat – نظام الطيبات للدكتور العوضي</strong></p>
    <p>Last updated: September 6, 2026</p>
  </header>

  <main>

    <h2>1. About Taybaat</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Taybaat – نظام الطيبات للدكتور العوضي</strong>
      is an Android application designed to help users organize and manage
      food-related information, meal planning, food lists, shopping lists,
      meal history, fasting preferences, and related personal planning
      activities.
    </p>

    <p>
      The application is designed as a local-first application. The
      information you enter and generate while using Taybaat is stored
      locally on your Android device.
    </p>

    <div class="important">
      <strong>Privacy summary:</strong>
      Taybaat does not operate a user account system and does not send your
      personal app data to our servers. The app does not use advertising,
      analytics, crash-reporting, or other third-party tracking services.
    </div>


    <h2>2. Information Stored by the App</h2>

    <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>

    <p>
      Depending on the features you use, Taybaat may store information such
      as:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Your name or preferred name entered in the app</li>
      <li>Meal plans and planned meals</li>
      <li>Food quantities and selected units</li>
      <li>Foods added to your favorites</li>
      <li>Foods added to your personal list</li>
      <li>Shopping-list items</li>
      <li>Meal completion and related history</li>
      <li>Fasting preferences and planning information</li>
      <li>Application language and theme preferences</li>
      <li>Other settings and information required for the app's features</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2.2 Where This Information Is Stored</h3>

    <p>
      The information described above is stored locally on your Android
      device using the app's local storage systems.
    </p>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not maintain an online account containing this information
      and does not upload this information to a Taybaat server.
    </p>


    <h2>3. Food Database</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat contains a built-in food database used by the application's
      food search, classification, meal planning, and related features.
    </p>

    <p>
      The built-in food database is part of the application and is not
      personal user data. Your use of the food database does not require you
      to create an account or submit personal information to us.
    </p>

    <p>
      Food identifiers and internal application data are used to maintain
      the application's functionality. They are not used to identify you
      personally.
    </p>


    <h2>4. Data Collection and Sharing</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not collect or transmit personal information to external
      servers for advertising, analytics, profiling, or account management.
    </p>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not currently use:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Advertising services or ad networks</li>
      <li>Google AdMob</li>
      <li>Analytics services</li>
      <li>Third-party crash-reporting services</li>
      <li>Third-party tracking or profiling services</li>
      <li>User accounts or authentication services</li>
      <li>In-app payment or billing services</li>
      <li>WebView-based external content services</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Accordingly, Taybaat does not sell, rent, or share your personal app
      information with third parties for advertising or marketing purposes.
    </p>


    <h2>5. Internet and Network Access</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat is designed to operate using locally stored application and
      user data. The application does not require an online account or a
      Taybaat cloud service to use its core features.
    </p>

    <p>
      External web pages, such as this Privacy Policy or other legal
      information, may be opened using your device's web browser when you
      choose to view them. Opening an external webpage is handled by your
      browser and is separate from Taybaat's local storage of your app data.
    </p>


    <h2>6. Notifications</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat may use Android notifications for features such as meal
      reminders or other user-enabled reminders.
    </p>

    <p>
      On Android versions that require notification permission, Taybaat asks
      for the appropriate notification permission before sending
      notifications.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can deny or later disable notification permission through your
      Android device settings. Disabling notifications does not prevent you
      from using the application's other core features.
    </p>


    <h2>7. Data Deletion</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat provides functionality to delete the personal information and
      user-created content stored by the application.
    </p>

    <p>
      When you use the application's data-deletion functionality, user data
      such as the following may be removed:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Your saved name</li>
      <li>Planned meals and planned food entries</li>
      <li>Meal and classification history</li>
      <li>Shopping-list items</li>
      <li>Favorites and personal food-list entries</li>
      <li>Other user-created planning information stored by the app</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      The built-in Taybaat food database is application content rather than
      personal user data and is therefore retained so that the application
      can continue to function normally.
    </p>

    <p>
      Application language and theme preferences may also remain stored
      because they are application preferences rather than personal
      planning content.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Important:</strong>
      Because Taybaat does not maintain a cloud account containing your
      information, there is no Taybaat server database from which your
      personal data must be separately deleted.
    </div>


    <h2>8. Uninstalling the Application</h2>

    <p>
      Uninstalling Taybaat removes the application's locally stored data from
      your device, subject to the behavior of your Android device and any
      operating-system backup mechanisms you may have enabled.
    </p>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not retain a separate copy of your personal app data on
      its own servers.
    </p>


    <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat is not designed as a children's application. It is intended
      for general users who can independently use the application's
      food-planning and wellness-related features.
    </p>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not knowingly collect personal information from children
      through an online service because the application does not operate an
      online account or personal-data collection system.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you believe that personal information has been provided to us in
      connection with Taybaat in a manner that raises a privacy concern,
      please contact us using the contact information below.
    </p>


    <h2>10. Security</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat uses Android's application storage mechanisms to store
      application data locally on the user's device.
    </p>

    <p>
      We take reasonable measures within the application architecture to
      protect locally stored application information. However, no electronic
      storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
    </p>

    <p>
      Users should also protect their Android device with appropriate
      security measures such as a screen lock and current operating-system
      updates.
    </p>


    <h2>11. Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not currently integrate advertising, analytics,
      authentication, billing, or other third-party services that collect
      your personal information for Taybaat's business purposes.
    </p>

    <p>
      When you voluntarily open an external legal webpage, your Android
      browser handles that webpage according to the browser's and website
      provider's own privacy practices.
    </p>


    <h2>12. Your Privacy Rights</h2>

    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have privacy rights under
      applicable laws, including rights relating to access, deletion,
      correction, restriction, or objection to the processing of personal
      information.
    </p>

    <p>
      Because Taybaat stores its user-created information locally and does
      not maintain an online account or server-side user database, many
      privacy controls can be exercised directly through the application or
      your Android device.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you have a privacy-related question or request that cannot be
      resolved through the application, you may contact us using the
      information provided below.
    </p>


    <h2>13. No Advertising or Personalized Tracking</h2>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not display third-party advertising and does not use
      advertising identifiers for personalized advertising.
    </p>

    <p>
      Taybaat does not use behavioral tracking to create advertising profiles
      about users.
    </p>


    <h2>14. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes
      to the application, applicable laws, or our privacy practices.
    </p>

    <p>
      When changes are made, the updated version will be published on this
      webpage and, where appropriate, made available through the Taybaat
      application.
    </p>

    <p>
      The date at the top of this Privacy Policy indicates when it was most
      recently updated.
    </p>


    <h2>15. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
      If you have questions, concerns, feedback, or privacy requests
      regarding Taybaat, please contact us:
    </p>

